            "detailed_description": "<strong>ALQOM: A Large Quantity Of Mushrooms</strong> is an experimental game/experience, exploring the potential of <strong>Virtual Reality </strong>to create unique atmospheric experiences. Slow-paced exploration with puzzle elements. The mushrooms will take you to a dark, surreal world. Walk around, explore, discover hidden areas, experiences, secrets. Sit down, look around, take in the atmosphere, and experience a sense of mystery, wonder, ethereal beauty. Find strange items, play with them and experiment, see how they can alter your perception of the world and lead you to new places.<br><br><br><strong>Early access version is available for Oculus Rift with Touch controllers only</strong>. Other platforms and input methods are planned for later.<br><br>Purchasing the early access grants you access to all future updates at no additional charge.",
